            "review_title": "Review at Pepperonis Pizza",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nYour Standard Italian Chain\nMay 2020\nPeperoni's is actually one of very few sit-down restaurants in this part of Long Bien, Ha Noi. But, while it's not Vietnamese and not the best Italian, it's certainly a good option for lunch or dinner. The restaurant has multiple levels of seating but in the just-post-COVID era, only the ground floor was open. That was OK. We actually ordered ribs, spaghetti carbonara and lasagna. The ribs were only OK and tasted pre-cooked/reheated. But the lasanga and spaghetti were really good. The wait staff was friendly and even though no one spoke English with us but our waitress clearly understood us. Overall, it was a very enjoyable lunch.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 8, 2020",
